      "ws_voice_1_0#2": [
        {
          "Name": "voice_0",
          "Sound": "assets/voices/source_adv_voice_anotherstory_10454_012.wav",
          "Command": "lip_sync enforce",
          "Priority": 9,
          "Interruptable": true,
          "PostCommand": "lip_sync enable; start_mtn ournotes_l2d_carrier_sub_raikas_grandmother ws_manual_voice_finished_1#9",
          "Text": "嗯，早上好！\n懂得规规矩矩地打招呼，这才算得上是优秀的Family嘛！"
        },
        {
          "Name": "voice_1",
          "Sound": "assets/voices/source_adv_voice_anotherstory_10454_024.wav",
          "Command": "lip_sync enforce",
          "Priority": 9,
          "Interruptable": true,
          "PostCommand": "lip_sync enable; start_mtn ournotes_l2d_carrier_sub_raikas_grandmother ws_manual_voice_finished_1#9",
          "Text": "啊哈哈，还有好多别的！\n大家要和睦地分一分哦！"
        },
        {
          "Name": "voice_2",
          "Sound": "assets/voices/source_adv_voice_anotherstory_10454_026.wav",
          "Command": "lip_sync enforce",
          "Priority": 9,
          "Interruptable": true,
          "PostCommand": "lip_sync enable; start_mtn ournotes_l2d_carrier_sub_raikas_grandmother ws_manual_voice_finished_1#9",
          "Text": "哎呀，看到你们笑得这么开心，\n下一趟旅行我也能放心出发了"
        },
        {
          "Name": "voice_3",
          "Sound": "assets/voices/source_adv_voice_anotherstory_10454_001.wav",
          "Command": "lip_sync enforce",
          "Priority": 9,
          "Interruptable": true,
          "PostCommand": "lip_sync enable; start_mtn ournotes_l2d_carrier_sub_raikas_grandmother ws_manual_voice_finished_1#9",
          "Text": "喂～～～！！\n小鬼们都起床啦～～～～～～！！！"
        },
        {
          "Name": "voice_4",
          "Sound": "assets/voices/source_adv_voice_anotherstory_10454_028.wav",
          "Command": "lip_sync enforce",
          "Priority": 9,
          "Interruptable": true,
          "PostCommand": "lip_sync enable; start_mtn ournotes_l2d_carrier_sub_raikas_grandmother ws_manual_voice_finished_1#9",
          "Text": "嗯。今天傍晚的飞机。\n『Nest』合约那边的事情也都谈完了"
        },
        {
          "Name": "voice_5",
          "Sound": "assets/voices/source_adv_voice_anotherstory_10454_015.wav",
          "Command": "lip_sync enforce",
          "Priority": 9,
          "Interruptable": true,
          "PostCommand": "lip_sync enable; start_mtn ournotes_l2d_carrier_sub_raikas_grandmother ws_manual_voice_finished_1#9",
          "Text": "啊，突然过来不好意思啊！\n上次来的时候没来得及给你们"
        },
        {
          "Name": "voice_6",
          "Sound": "assets/voices/source_adv_voice_anotherstory_10454_030.wav",
          "Command": "lip_sync enforce",
          "Priority": 9,
          "Interruptable": true,
          "PostCommand": "lip_sync enable; start_mtn ournotes_l2d_carrier_sub_raikas_grandmother ws_manual_voice_finished_1#9",
          "Text": "是啊，那家旅馆很不错～还有人还在睡懒觉，\n也有人抓紧最后一刻还在泡温泉"
        }
      ],
